    <bpmn:startEvent id="startE_5b3002a0" name="Content Dispute Identified">
      <bpmn:documentation>P-Tronics is disputing edits made to the Power electronics article by Wtshymanski and DaCozyMan, claiming their improvements are &quot;awful&quot; and requesting assistance in resolving the disagreement.</bpmn:documentation>
